  - title: 02 / Levitate and spin
    explanation: Calibrate the radial and axial gap channels. Lift off the touchdown
      bearings, precharge the drives, then perform a low-speed trial and resonance
      scan.
    caption: 8 BEARING STATIONS
    parts:
    - id: input
      kind: 9
      position: {x: 0.18, y: 0.71}
      label: CAL
      color: {r: 0.18, g: 0.86, b: 0.94, a: 1}
    - id: tracking
      kind: 9
      position: {x: 0.71, y: 0.71}
      label: LIFT
      color: {r: 1, g: 0.71, b: 0.31, a: 1}
    - id: output
      kind: 9
      position: {x: 0.82, y: 0.71}
      label: SCAN
      color: {r: 0.18, g: 0.86, b: 0.94, a: 1}
    wires:
    - points:
      - {x: 0.25, y: 0.71}
      - {x: 0.43, y: 0.71}
      energized: 0
